  ],
  "overall_basis": "The rationale only assesses that the comment fails to pinpoint a specific part of the paper, and completely omits assessment of the specificity of the comment's request. The comment clearly specifies what content needs to be added, which aligns with gold score 3, so the rationale supports the incorrect score."
